mode: "100644"
text: "# The DATES framework — plan the few moments that fit, far in advance\n\nThe planned counterpart to `trend-jacking`. The agent **maps the moments + gates fit/authenticity + tiers +\nplans the angle/lead-time + feeds the content-calendar**; big commercial moments → `campaign-and-launch-\nplanning`; **WoopSocial schedules the planned content ahead.**\n\n## D — Decide the moments that matter\n- Build **YOUR brand's** moment calendar from the 500+ out there: seasons, retail anchors, **relevant**\n  awareness months, industry events, company milestones. **Not every internet holiday** — \"not every holiday\n  deserves a post.\"\n\n## A — Audit for fit + standing\n- **Fit gate:** does it match **brand / audience / goals**? **Authenticity gate:** for identity/cause moments\n  (Pride, MLK, Juneteenth, Earth Day) — **genuine year-round commitment?** If you can't answer **\"why us, why\n  this moment?\"** with something real, **stay quiet.** No rainbow-washing.\n\n## T — Tier by weight + sensitivity\n- **Tier 1** commercial/fun (go — BFCM/Halloween/Valentine's, strongest ROI) · **Tier 2** authentic-alignment\n  required (Pride/Earth Day) · **Tier 3** cultural/solemn (non-promotional respect — religious/remembrance\n  days). **Match effort to payoff:** big commercial = a **campaign** → `campaign-and-launch-planning`.\n\n## E — Engineer it early\n- The predictable-moment advantage: **8–12 weeks** ahead for major, **2–4** for minor. Run big moments as a\n  **multi-week series**, not one post. Brief creative/offers in advance. (Opposite of `trend-jacking`'s\n  reactivity.)\n\n## S — Slot it in + measure\n- Feed the **`content-calendar`**; **schedule ahead via WoopSocial**; leave **~50% open** for reactive\n  (`trend-jacking`); **measure vs the moment's goal** (engagement vs sales); **quarterly** review\n  planned-vs-actual. Never fabricate.\n\n## The moment plan a request should fill\n```\nMOMENT + DATE (confirm 2026 date/market) | CATEGORY (commercial/cultural/awareness/fun) | GEO\nFIT: brand/audience/goal match? \"why us, why this moment?\"  -> if no real answer, SIT OUT\nTIER: 1 commercial/fun | 2 authentic-alignment-required | 3 cultural/solemn (non-promotional)  | brand-safety: safe/sensitive/caution\nANGLE + FORMAT + CHANNEL (one date -> several formats); beyond \"happy [day]\"\nLEAD TIME: major 8-12 wks / minor 2-4 wks; multi-week series for big moments (-> campaign-and-launch-planning + paid)\nSLOT (WoopSocial): schedule ahead via content-calendar; GOAL + how measured. Leave ~50% open for trend-jacking.\n```\n"
